# 🧩 **Tri‑Stream Execution Cycle (v1.0)**  
This defines how envelopes enter the Capsule, how routing occurs, how IC/Dev/Meta streams execute, and how the cycle resets.  
It is deterministic, reversible, and drift‑neutral.

